WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.396
- So, what you're about to see

00:00:01.396 --> 00:00:03.127
is a really interesting interaction.

00:00:03.127 --> 00:00:06.736
A lovely lady that I kind
of spoke on the stage

00:00:06.736 --> 00:00:09.268
after my talk, and then,
came up and got a book.

00:00:09.268 --> 00:00:12.267
Then, she came back and kudos to her

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:15.427
to ask some questions about her business.

00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:17.660
As you guys know, normally
I'm giving one or two

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.867
quick answers 'cause I don't
have time unfortunately,

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:24.083
in settings like this, but
something caught my attention,

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.601
and I dig into the details

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:29.120
and get into some of the
kind of questions I would ask

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.474
if I were with you and
kind of the questions

00:00:31.474 --> 00:00:33.907
that I would hope that
you're asking yourself

00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:37.103
as you're trying to figure out
why something's not working.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.915
- I'm going to tell you my
story, if I can take over?

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.764
I'm running a food truck.

00:00:41.764 --> 00:00:43.235
I'm not the market here.

00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:44.930
I'm startup.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.054
The reason why I'm here is you.

00:00:47.054 --> 00:00:49.743
I'd never know what this market is for.

00:00:49.743 --> 00:00:51.292
I learned a lot today.

00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:55.384
My story is I had one truck one
year ago, American barbecue.

00:00:55.384 --> 00:00:57.101
Nobody knows about the barbecue.

00:00:57.101 --> 00:00:57.934
- Here?

00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:59.869
- I'm talking about 100 kilometers out.

00:00:59.869 --> 00:01:02.620
It runs really good, really good.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.615
And then, think big, take the market.

00:01:05.615 --> 00:01:08.021
I bought another one and another one.

00:01:08.021 --> 00:01:09.264
Then ...

00:01:09.264 --> 00:01:10.692
- Got stretched.

00:01:10.692 --> 00:01:11.577
- My revenue ...

00:01:11.577 --> 00:01:12.410
- You moved too fast.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:13.886
- I moved too fast.

00:01:13.886 --> 00:01:16.263
Now, I'm at the bottom

00:01:16.263 --> 00:01:18.930
and I don't know what was wrong.

00:01:19.811 --> 00:01:22.276
- You're not sure why it happened?

00:01:22.276 --> 00:01:23.504
- No, actually not.

00:01:23.504 --> 00:01:24.751
Is it the market?

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.403
Was my message not clear enough?

00:01:27.403 --> 00:01:28.294
My product is good.

00:01:28.294 --> 00:01:29.225
- So let me help you.

00:01:29.225 --> 00:01:30.093
- My product is good.

00:01:30.093 --> 00:01:31.077
- Let me help you a little bit.

00:01:31.077 --> 00:01:31.910
Let me help you.

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:32.743
- Please.

00:01:32.743 --> 00:01:34.719
- The first thing I would do to ...

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:36.395
First of all, I love you for being honest.

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:37.700
To say, "I don't know what went wrong,"

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.509
is very important, very powerful.

00:01:39.509 --> 00:01:43.369
If you go backwards, the
first thing I would do,

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.385
like if I was buying 50% of your company.

00:01:45.385 --> 00:01:46.390
Now, we're partners.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:50.239
I would say, okay, first
meeting, 9 a.m., 7 a.m.,

00:01:50.239 --> 00:01:53.527
you know, first meeting,
"Tell me everything."

00:01:53.527 --> 00:01:56.528
Tell me what you did, everything you did

00:01:56.528 --> 00:01:59.584
when you were running one truck.

00:01:59.584 --> 00:02:03.368
Then, tell me what you did,
you, you when you had three.

00:02:03.368 --> 00:02:06.093
My belief is that when you had one

00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:08.506
all the energy was going in one places

00:02:08.506 --> 00:02:12.673
which means you were going
further down the line, deeper

00:02:13.806 --> 00:02:17.975
and somewhere in there was
the most important thing

00:02:17.975 --> 00:02:20.343
that you had to not be able to do

00:02:20.343 --> 00:02:23.343
when you became the manager of three.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.673
That's it.

00:02:24.673 --> 00:02:25.677
That's it.

00:02:25.677 --> 00:02:28.306
I'm telling you, what's
very exciting for me to be--

00:02:28.306 --> 00:02:30.080
- So what is now the advice?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.424
To go back to one?

00:02:31.424 --> 00:02:32.552
- Probably, probably.

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.622
- To focus or to go to diversity?

00:02:33.622 --> 00:02:34.455
- Or.

00:02:34.455 --> 00:02:35.920
- Say, "Okay, I'm selling Italian pizza?"

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.395
- No, no, no, definitely not that.

00:02:37.395 --> 00:02:38.575
Definitely not that.

00:02:38.575 --> 00:02:39.686
- Italian pizza is good.

00:02:39.686 --> 00:02:40.893
- Respect, respect.

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:42.251
- Yeah, but I'm a barbecue person.

00:02:42.251 --> 00:02:43.463
- Definitely, definitely not diversity.

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:44.451
Definitely not.

00:02:44.451 --> 00:02:45.284
- Okay.

00:02:45.284 --> 00:02:47.750
- If it worked at one,
it would work at 100.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.798
You stopped doing something

00:02:50.798 --> 00:02:53.715
at three that you used to do at one

00:02:54.837 --> 00:02:57.612
that became the vulnerability.

00:02:57.612 --> 00:03:00.664
So did you used to be
the front of the truck?

00:03:00.664 --> 00:03:02.211
- Yeah, a lot more of course.

00:03:02.211 --> 00:03:03.044
- Great.

00:03:03.044 --> 00:03:03.877
Now, you're not.

00:03:03.877 --> 00:03:04.814
You can't be in three trucks.

00:03:04.814 --> 00:03:05.647
- No.

00:03:05.647 --> 00:03:07.624
- So the next question
becomes are the two people

00:03:07.624 --> 00:03:10.163
that are the front of the
truck not the kind of people

00:03:10.163 --> 00:03:12.332
that people want to buy barbecue from?

00:03:12.332 --> 00:03:13.246
Maybe, maybe not.

00:03:13.246 --> 00:03:14.079
I don't know.

00:03:14.079 --> 00:03:15.739
- It might be one of the problem.

00:03:15.739 --> 00:03:18.746
- Next, you can take a step back.

00:03:18.746 --> 00:03:20.639
I believe you the quality of the food,

00:03:20.639 --> 00:03:23.895
but everything I would ask:
was the food consistent?

00:03:23.895 --> 00:03:25.503
Did you have the same exact ingredients?

00:03:25.503 --> 00:03:26.889
Do you have like all that?

00:03:26.889 --> 00:03:28.597
Probably yes 'cause that's not that hard.

00:03:28.597 --> 00:03:29.430
- Yeah, sure.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.263
- But maybe not.

00:03:30.263 --> 00:03:31.146
Maybe you had a little less this.

00:03:31.146 --> 00:03:32.665
Maybe you had a spread.

00:03:32.665 --> 00:03:33.727
I don't know what your allocation.

00:03:33.727 --> 00:03:36.622
- We did some adjustments to the recipes

00:03:36.622 --> 00:03:39.682
and to the portions and
so on, but it's normal.

00:03:39.682 --> 00:03:42.233
We were stocked up, we did
mistakes, we corrected.

00:03:42.233 --> 00:03:43.190
- I get it, but--

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.681
- But the market punished
me with no revenue

00:03:45.681 --> 00:03:47.569
and now I'm there and I don't know.

00:03:47.569 --> 00:03:48.402
Do I sell?

00:03:48.402 --> 00:03:49.693
Do I keep going?

00:03:49.693 --> 00:03:52.404
I am working, working, working
and it's not going better.

00:03:52.404 --> 00:03:53.495
- Understood.

00:03:53.495 --> 00:03:55.099
So, let's go back.

00:03:55.099 --> 00:03:58.204
The number one truck, did
it stay in a certain area?

00:03:58.204 --> 00:03:59.037
- Yeah.

00:03:59.037 --> 00:04:00.205
- Does it still stay in that certain area?

00:04:00.205 --> 00:04:01.038
- Yes.

00:04:01.038 --> 00:04:03.095
- Is it still doing the
same revenue or down?

00:04:03.095 --> 00:04:05.362
- The one truck is doing good revenue.

00:04:05.362 --> 00:04:09.252
The other two, they are
not meeting expectation.

00:04:09.252 --> 00:04:10.090
- Understood.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.422
Your overhead is greater
than what you're getting?

00:04:12.422 --> 00:04:14.764
- My assumption was one
truck is doing revenue X,

00:04:14.764 --> 00:04:16.023
three trucks is going to do--

00:04:16.023 --> 00:04:16.856
- Three X.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:17.689
- Three Xs.

00:04:17.689 --> 00:04:18.522
That was wrong.

00:04:18.522 --> 00:04:19.355
- Let me ask you a question.

00:04:19.355 --> 00:04:20.855
- Why is it wrong?

00:04:58.484 --> 00:05:00.033
- I got an idea.

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:02.283
Can you type in the address

00:05:04.519 --> 00:05:06.519
where you park the cars?

00:05:07.815 --> 00:05:08.648
- Yeah.

00:05:08.648 --> 00:05:11.060
- Go ahead, type it in.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:14.050
Yeah, I mean, it goes so detailed.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.251
That's how you win.

00:05:15.251 --> 00:05:16.661
It's in the trenches.

00:05:16.661 --> 00:05:17.965
- Yeah, that's the right one.

00:05:17.965 --> 00:05:19.174
- Okay, I'm gonna show you something.

00:05:19.174 --> 00:05:20.007
- Yeah?

00:05:20.007 --> 00:05:24.087
- Everyday what time do
the trucks start operating?

00:05:24.087 --> 00:05:25.897
- 11:30 to two o'clock

00:05:25.897 --> 00:05:27.885
and then on the weekend
you know when we are out.

00:05:27.885 --> 00:05:28.718
- Good.

00:05:28.718 --> 00:05:31.428
I'm gonna show you something
that I want you to do.

00:05:31.428 --> 00:05:34.261
I want you to click this everyday.

00:05:35.196 --> 00:05:36.029
Everyday.

00:05:36.029 --> 00:05:36.986
You have Instagram, right?

00:05:36.986 --> 00:05:37.979
- Mmm hmm.

00:05:37.979 --> 00:05:40.287
- Okay, so this is that
town that you're in, right?

00:05:40.287 --> 00:05:41.267
- [Lady] Right here.

00:05:41.267 --> 00:05:45.100
- I want you to click
the photo of the person.

00:05:46.559 --> 00:05:49.226
So you'll get the person, right?

00:05:50.081 --> 00:05:53.125
I want you to send a message.

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:54.319
Do you know how to do that?

00:05:54.319 --> 00:05:55.389
- [Lady] Of course.

00:05:55.389 --> 00:05:56.222
- [Gary] You sure?

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:57.114
I want to make sure you get this.

00:05:57.114 --> 00:05:59.165
When you go on somebody's
profile, the button's up here.

00:05:59.165 --> 00:06:00.210
- [Lady] Okay, send message.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.185
- [Gary] And then send message.

00:06:01.185 --> 00:06:02.092
- [Lady] Okay.

00:06:02.092 --> 00:06:02.925
(clicking)

00:06:02.925 --> 00:06:04.518
- [Gary] Saw your profile.

00:06:04.518 --> 00:06:08.518
Come by my truck today
from 11:00 to two o'clock

00:06:10.231 --> 00:06:12.166
and I'll give you a free barbecue.

00:06:12.166 --> 00:06:13.715
I want you to do that ten times

00:06:13.715 --> 00:06:15.931
to 20 times every single day.

00:06:15.931 --> 00:06:16.764
- [Lady] Okay.

00:06:16.764 --> 00:06:18.864
- It's my belief that ...

00:06:18.864 --> 00:06:20.858
Now, pay attention to what I showed you.

00:06:20.858 --> 00:06:22.188
I'm gonna go a little slower.

00:06:22.188 --> 00:06:24.932
When you go to a town and
when you get to your phone

00:06:24.932 --> 00:06:26.496
maybe you can even say the street

00:06:26.496 --> 00:06:28.153
so it could be even closer.

00:06:28.153 --> 00:06:31.988
When you go there, what
it shows you on Instagram

00:06:31.988 --> 00:06:35.587
is the nine posts that
are the most popular

00:06:35.587 --> 00:06:38.843
and then in order the people
that did it the most recent.

00:06:38.843 --> 00:06:41.251
- [Lady] I don't see your influencer.

00:06:41.251 --> 00:06:43.130
- See, she did this 13 minutes ago.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.871
So either it's people that
are right there right now

00:06:46.871 --> 00:06:51.727
or it's people with bigger
influence who are there.

00:06:51.727 --> 00:06:55.469
I could tag myself
here, but then I'm gone.

00:06:55.469 --> 00:06:58.570
But if you look, she has 3000 followers.

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.318
Maybe she lives there.

00:07:00.318 --> 00:07:03.420
If you message her and say, "I
like your Instagram profile.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.574
"I like Instagram.

00:07:04.574 --> 00:07:05.440
"My food truck is here.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.415
"Come by and I'll give
you free lunch today."

00:07:08.415 --> 00:07:12.490
I believe one in every
10 will come everyday

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.862
and I believe that.

00:07:13.862 --> 00:07:16.677
- 10% catching rate is
a real dream for me.

00:07:16.677 --> 00:07:17.768
- But you're giving it for free.

00:07:17.768 --> 00:07:18.760
Hear me out.

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:22.945
One in every 10 will come and
then one in every 10 of those,

00:07:22.945 --> 00:07:25.240
'cause you're not gonna ask,

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:28.009
is gonna post and say, "Delicious."

00:07:28.009 --> 00:07:30.128
I believe that that is worth 30 minutes

00:07:30.128 --> 00:07:31.589
of your time everyday.

00:07:31.589 --> 00:07:33.259
Here's why.

00:07:33.259 --> 00:07:35.105
My numbers could be totally wrong.

00:07:35.105 --> 00:07:37.385
Four out of every 10 could come

00:07:37.385 --> 00:07:40.108
and three out of every
10 of those could post,

00:07:40.108 --> 00:07:41.988
but here's what's more important.

00:07:41.988 --> 00:07:42.821
One post.

00:07:43.949 --> 00:07:47.409
You get the right girlfriend
of a soccer player,

00:07:47.409 --> 00:07:49.788
you get the right influencer,

00:07:49.788 --> 00:07:53.324
one post can change
your business overnight.

00:07:53.324 --> 00:07:54.706
- Thank you.

00:07:54.706 --> 00:07:57.499
- That's one little tactic
that I want you to do.

00:07:57.499 --> 00:07:58.931
It will work.

00:07:58.931 --> 00:08:02.114
- Okay, but I'll keep my three trucks.

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:03.520
I'm not going back to one.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:05.019
- So I know I'm going macro.

00:08:05.019 --> 00:08:07.936
On the micro, you know, for me, me.

00:08:09.901 --> 00:08:13.818
If you sold one of your
trucks and went to two,

00:08:15.486 --> 00:08:18.768
I would look at the math of
what that would look like.

00:08:18.768 --> 00:08:21.367
Intuitively, I'm not ready to make a call.

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:23.545
I'd have to look at your
business more carefully.

00:08:23.545 --> 00:08:25.962
Intuitively, two feels right.

00:08:27.734 --> 00:08:32.015
- Yeah, but then I have
to go back to the base.

00:08:32.015 --> 00:08:34.036
Then, I have to do all the work

00:08:34.036 --> 00:08:37.362
because I don't have enough
money to pay somebody to do.

00:08:37.362 --> 00:08:39.067
- And three does that for you?

00:08:39.067 --> 00:08:41.889
- Yeah, would be if they
would get the revenue.

00:08:41.889 --> 00:08:42.722
- But they don't.

00:08:42.722 --> 00:08:43.555
- They don't.

00:08:43.555 --> 00:08:45.893
- So how close are you to the revenue?

00:08:45.893 --> 00:08:47.970
- I don't know, 30%.

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.725
- To 30 of the 100%?

00:08:49.725 --> 00:08:50.558
- Yes.

00:08:54.494 --> 00:08:56.263
- What are you doing to market?

00:08:56.263 --> 00:08:57.798
Anything?

00:08:57.798 --> 00:09:01.354
- I have Facebook, we have 5000 plus

00:09:01.354 --> 00:09:03.430
or almost 6000 followers.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:04.780
- What about Instagram?

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:05.613
- No.

00:09:05.613 --> 00:09:06.446
- Instagram.

00:09:06.446 --> 00:09:07.710
- Instagram is the key?

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:08.684
- You have to understand why.

00:09:08.684 --> 00:09:11.084
Facebook, when you post something

00:09:11.084 --> 00:09:15.234
1% of the audience sees it organically.

00:09:15.234 --> 00:09:17.968
Instagram is 40% organic.

00:09:17.968 --> 00:09:19.540
- But Instagram is taking pictures,

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.093
taking photos and posting.

00:09:21.093 --> 00:09:21.926
- Or video.

00:09:21.926 --> 00:09:23.492
- I have to go out and take pictures.

00:09:23.492 --> 00:09:25.323
I have to go out and do the photos.

00:09:25.323 --> 00:09:26.202
- No you don't.

00:09:26.202 --> 00:09:27.919
- Or do I have to pay
somebody to do it for me?

00:09:27.919 --> 00:09:28.752
- Nope.

00:09:28.752 --> 00:09:31.787
You're sitting in the truck
and you take a picture

00:09:31.787 --> 00:09:33.402
or take a picture of the meal

00:09:33.402 --> 00:09:34.888
or take a picture of the line

00:09:34.888 --> 00:09:36.548
or take a picture of one person

00:09:36.548 --> 00:09:37.895
or take a picture of the flowers

00:09:37.895 --> 00:09:40.555
that are across the
street from your truck.

00:09:40.555 --> 00:09:42.444
Build a micro-local presence

00:09:42.444 --> 00:09:44.337
'cause you have a micro-local business.

00:09:44.337 --> 00:09:45.616
- Yeah.

00:09:45.616 --> 00:09:47.700
- Interview people maybe.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.273
This might not come natural to you,

00:09:49.273 --> 00:09:51.986
but maybe at first, slow.

00:09:51.986 --> 00:09:53.336
- Am I too old for this?

00:09:53.336 --> 00:09:54.169
(laughs)

00:09:54.169 --> 00:09:55.002
- 100% not.

00:09:55.002 --> 00:09:55.835
- I don't know.

00:09:55.835 --> 00:09:56.668
- 100% not.

00:09:56.668 --> 00:09:58.506
- A lot of people are saying
to me, "Oh, you are annoying me

00:09:58.506 --> 00:10:00.728
"with lot of posts on
Facebook and so on and so on."

00:10:00.728 --> 00:10:01.730
- Instagram.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:05.183
- Okay, Instagram and then influencers.

00:10:05.183 --> 00:10:06.545
I'll let you know.

00:10:06.545 --> 00:10:07.378
- Let me know.

00:10:07.378 --> 00:10:08.251
(laughs)

00:10:08.251 --> 00:10:09.309
- I'll let you know.
- Good luck.

00:10:09.309 --> 00:10:10.660
- Thank you very much.
- So good to see you.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.160
(light music)

